id=imsforge
name=imsforge (CarrierSettings IMS patch)
version=v2.1.2
versionCode=5
author=okhsunrog
description=Enables VoLTE / VoWiFi / VoNR for carriers Google never certified. Patches the CarrierSettings protobufs on the device at every boot, so it survives OS updates and needs no per-device build. Requires a mount backend (KernelSU: NoMount, Mountify or meta-overlayfs; Magisk has one built in).
